<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLAND 161-8 AT CLOSE IN THIRD TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 161-8 AT CLOSE IN THIRD TEST.</headline>
<dateline>MANCHESTER, England 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>England were 161-8 at the close of play in reply to Australia's first innings total of 235 on the second day of the third cricket test against Australia at Old Trafford on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 235 (S.Waugh 108; D.Headley 4-72, D.Gough 3-52), England 161-8 (M.Butcher 51)</p>
